# From "Five Messages" (Wave IV - Adventure, CD1-2). The tape asks for the
# messages in descending order -- fifth first, first last -- kept as it has
# it rather than reordered.

@segment  five-messages
@title    Five Messages
@levels   F12
@duration ~4m

say From Focus 12, five important messages are waiting for you in the far reaches of your expanded awareness.
pause 6
say Some have been there always, just beyond memory. Others are things of vital importance you haven't been aware of. They may arrive as words, pictures, pure understanding, direct experience, or contact with someone else -- or all of these together. However they arrive, you'll receive, understand, and remember their value.
pause 10
say Ask now for your fifth message. Send the request out into your total awareness, and wait.
pause 15
say You'll understand and remember it, once you're back.
pause 6
say Ask now for your fourth message. Send it out, and wait.
pause 15
say You'll understand and remember it, once you're back.
pause 6
say Ask now for your third message. Send it out, and wait.
pause 15
say You'll understand and remember it, once you're back.
pause 6
say Ask now for your second message. Send it out, and wait.
pause 15
say You'll understand and remember it, once you're back.
pause 6
say Now, ask for your first and most important message. Send it out, and wait.
pause 18
say You'll remember and understand all five, carefully and thoroughly, once you're back.
pause 8
